1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:02,960
Do you read fairy tales?
你读童话吗？

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:06,430
Have you ever dreamed of stepping into a fairy tale?
你有没有梦想过走进童话里？

3
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:10,860
If so, in Germany, your dream will come true.
如果有的话，你的梦想在德国就会成真。

4
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:20,790
Here, the German Fairy Tale Route can take you through ancient castles, thick forests and unusual villages—just like those in the stories we all know and love.
在这里，德国童话之路能带你穿行于古老的城堡、茂密的森林和与众不同的村庄之间——就像我们都熟悉、喜爱的那些故事里的一样。

5
00:00:21,590 --> 00:00:34,120
This special route, a 600-kilometer road, was set up in 1975 to remember the Brothers Grimm, two famous German storytellers—Jacob Grimm and his younger brother Wilhelm.
这条特别的路线是一条全长600千米的道路，设立于1975年，用来纪念格林兄弟，也就是两位著名的德国故事家——雅各布·格林和他的弟弟威廉。

6
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:41,110
Together, they collected and wrote hundreds of stories, and then published them in a book called Grimm’s Fairy Tales.
他们一起收集并写下了几百个故事，然后把这些故事收进一本名为《格林童话》的书里出版。

7
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:47,620
Some of their well-known stories include Cinderella, Snow White, Hansel and Gretel, and Sleeping Beauty.
他们广为人知的故事包括《灰姑娘》《白雪公主》《汉赛尔与格蕾特》和《睡美人》等。

8
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:52,370
The route starts in Hanau, the town where the Brothers Grimm were born.
这条路线从哈瑙开始，那是格林兄弟出生的城镇。

9
00:00:53,170 --> 00:00:56,690
From there, it winds north through beautiful countryside.
从那里开始，路线一路向北，蜿蜒穿过美丽的乡村。

10
00:00:57,490 --> 00:01:05,980
Along the route, visitors can see the childhood home of the Grimm brothers in Steinau and the university town of Marburg, where they studied.
沿着这条路线，游客可以看到格林兄弟在施泰瑙的童年故居，以及他们曾经求学的大学城马尔堡。

11
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:14,130
In Alsfeld, you can walk through Little Red Riding Hood country and imagine meeting the much-loved girl in her red hat.
在阿尔斯费尔德，你可以漫步穿过小红帽之乡，想象自己遇见那个戴着红帽子、深受喜爱的女孩。

12
00:01:14,930 --> 00:01:24,750
The route also passes through Hamelin, the setting of The Pied Piper of Hamelin, and ends in Bremen, where a statue of the Bremen Town Musicians welcomes visitors.
这条路线还经过《哈默尔恩的花衣吹笛手》的故事发生地哈默尔恩，终点是不来梅，那里有一座“不来梅的城市乐手”雕塑迎接着游客。

13
00:01:25,550 --> 00:01:31,820
Throughout the year, the German Fairy Tale Route hosts many events that breathe new life into old stories.
一年到头，德国童话之路都会举办许多活动，给古老的故事注入新的活力。

14
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:38,940
Visitors can enjoy movies, folk festivals, storytelling evenings, to name but a few.
游客可以欣赏电影、欢度民俗节日、参加讲故事晚会，这里仅举几例。

15
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:42,610
It’s more than just a journey through picturesque places.
它不仅仅是一段穿行于风景如画之地的旅程。

16
00:01:43,410 --> 00:01:46,280
It takes you right into the heart of storytelling itself.
它会带你直接走进讲故事本身的核心。

17
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:51,050
So pack your imagination and get ready for an unforgettable journey!
所以，把你的想象力装进行囊，为一段难忘的旅程做好准备吧！
